    <string name="settings_privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_body">Home, apps and local search work offline, with no ads, analytics or account. Optional online suggestions send what you type to your selected search engine. Weather cards send your chosen location to the weather provider. Both are off by default. Notification contents and backups are never uploaded by Chikku. External apps, Google Discover and hosted widgets follow their own privacy policies.</string>
